9900 REM ============================================
9901 REM SUBROUTINE: PRINT V AS $XX (2 hex digits)
9902 REM Input: V = integer 0 to 255
9903 REM ============================================
9910 PRINT "$";
9920 HI = INT(V / 16) : LO = V - HI * 16
9930 IF HI < 10 THEN PRINT CHR$(48+HI); : GOTO 9950
9940 PRINT CHR$(55+HI);
9950 IF LO < 10 THEN PRINT CHR$(48+LO); : RETURN
9960 PRINT CHR$(55+LO); : RETURN
